{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raccoons to Riches</strong> is a <strong>Shopkeeping Roguelike Deckbuilding</strong>\u00a0game powered by your raccoon shopkeeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a little Raccoon in the big world, and you've gotta become the ultimate shopkeeper! Assemble your stock of <strong>Item</strong> and <strong>Business Tactic</strong> cards! <strong>Hustle</strong> your way to incredible profits! Build up\u00a0your\u00a0<strong>Inventory </strong>and\u00a0<strong>Customer\u00a0Base</strong> as\u00a0you\u00a0turn\u00a0your<strong>\u00a0humble\u00a0shop\u00a0</strong>into an<strong> incredible shopping\u00a0destination</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Deckbuilding</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/b1acb5a6690e273a48960f8893e935e9.poster.avif?t=1759779034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/b1acb5a6690e273a48960f8893e935e9.webm?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/b1acb5a6690e273a48960f8893e935e9.mp4?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock your shop with valuable  <strong>Items </strong>that your customers will go crazy for. Specialize your shop for selling <strong>Armor</strong>, <strong>Weapons</strong>, <strong>Potions</strong>, or <strong>Food</strong>! Learn powerful <strong>Business Tactics</strong> to convince your customers to pay handsomely for your wares!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Your Shop Your Own</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/4e18409c045a2229a8df17c31e9d5dfc.poster.avif?t=1759779034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/4e18409c045a2229a8df17c31e9d5dfc.webm?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/4e18409c045a2229a8df17c31e9d5dfc.mp4?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>\u00a0</strong><br>Acquire powerful and fancy shop decorations to customize your <strong>Shelves</strong>, <strong>Carpet</strong>, <strong>Lighting</strong>, <strong>Workbench</strong>, and <strong>Sales Counter</strong>. They're easy on the eyes, and grant you powerful effects to further specialize your shop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Resource\u00a0System</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/c17224d0ed8cb9f0b955145a295d1cba.poster.avif?t=1759779034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/c17224d0ed8cb9f0b955145a295d1cba.webm?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/c17224d0ed8cb9f0b955145a295d1cba.mp4?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your Customers' <strong>Patience </strong>to sell them as many items as possible! Most actions cost Patience, and customers leave when they're all out, so you'd better act fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cultivate Your\u00a0Clientele\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/10fd6e7872a878c666c05302a6f01482.poster.avif?t=1759779034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/10fd6e7872a878c666c05302a6f01482.webm?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/10fd6e7872a878c666c05302a6f01482.mp4?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fulfill your\u00a0customers' needs\u00a0and\u00a0wants, word of\u00a0your\u00a0shop will\u00a0spread,\u00a0allowing\u00a0you\u00a0to\u00a0attract\u00a0new\u00a0types\u00a0of\u00a0customers,\u00a0or even\u00a0ban unwanted customers from\u00a0returning. Specialize your <strong>Customer Base</strong> to\u00a0match\u00a0your Shop's <strong>Inventory</strong> and <strong>Decorations</strong> for\u00a0maximum\u00a0profits!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft Your Way\u00a0to\u00a0Incredible\u00a0Profits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/2e3728cf60f4aae2f3a011db5f41609d.poster.avif?t=1759779034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/2e3728cf60f4aae2f3a011db5f41609d.webm?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/2e3728cf60f4aae2f3a011db5f41609d.mp4?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Craft\u00a0</strong>your Items together into brand new, more valuable Items that'll please an even wider array of Customers. With a bit of elbow grease, you can make just the thing your Customers desire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make\u00a0Rent\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/7825d274654461eabcd0b9c01fbb52e0.poster.avif?t=1759779034\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/7825d274654461eabcd0b9c01fbb52e0.webm?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/extras/7825d274654461eabcd0b9c01fbb52e0.mp4?t=1759779034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>We've all got bills to pay, especially here! Make sure you've got enough Gold to cover an ever-increasing amount of <strong>Weekly Payments</strong>. Can you keep up with the rising tide for a whole month and prove you've got what it takes to be the ultimate shopkeeper?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778620?t=1759779034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778620?t=1759779034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/1ffe648923e497db690ea6e151a8362151911934/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759779034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778620/1ffe648923e497db690ea6e151a8362151911934/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759779034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"